        "affinityEffect": "decrease"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_13",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Who could have left this?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_14"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_14",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "And more importantly… should I really go to this meeting?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_15"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_15",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I could simply not go. What if it's just a prank?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_16"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_16",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Hi!",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_17"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_17",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumscared.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "Haaa!",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_18"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_18",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumscared.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I jump and quickly turn around.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_19"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_19",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "A girl is standing behind me.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_20"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_20",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Her long lavender hair falls on either side of her face, with a few strands framing her eyes. She looks just as surprised as I am.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_21"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_21",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Uh… sorry!",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_22"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_22",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumreallyscared.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "She raises her hands slightly, as if to defend herself.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_23"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_23",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "I didn't mean to scare you…",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_24"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_24",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumscared.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "It's nothing. I was just distracted.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_25"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_25",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I discreetly slip the paper into my notebook before looking at her.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_26"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_26",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "Did you need something?",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_27"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_27",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Well… I'm one of your readers from the magazine club. I particularly liked the article where you wrote about…",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_28"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_28",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "She hesitates for a moment, as if trying to find the right words.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_29"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_29",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "I mean… I really liked it.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_30"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_30",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsurprised.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "Oh, thank you.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_31"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_31",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsurprised.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I smile at her.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_32"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_32",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumsmile.png",
    "speaker": "Me",
    "text": "That really means a lot. Writing for this club… it's the one place where I feel like I can share what I love with others.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_33"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_33",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumneutral.png",
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "She lowers her eyes slightly, fidgeting with her fingers.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/day.mp3",
    "next": "chapter1_34"
  },
  {
    "id": "chapter1_34",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/school_hallway.webp",
    "charImg": "images/characters/plumtalkneutral.png",
    "speaker": "Plum",
    "text": "Um… hmm…",
